<amll:meta key="album" value="门"/>
<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1884234616"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:28.670"><div begin="14.399" end="41.126" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="14.399" end="19.897" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.399" end="15.700">那道门好</span><span begin="15.700" end="16.692">像</span> <span begin="16.873" end="18.005">是道</span><span begin="18.283" end="18.689">枷</span><span begin="18.689" end="19.897">锁</span></p><p begin="20.522" end="27.410" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.522" end="21.907">困住了</span><span begin="21.907" end="23.386">我</span> <span begin="23.996" end="25.293">动弹不</span><span begin="25.293" end="27.410">得</span></p><p begin="28.227" end="33.873" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.227" end="30.271">发呆着难过</span> <span begin="30.468" end="31.670">失去</span><span begin="32.285" end="33.873">你的我</span></p><p begin="34.556" end="41.126" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.556" end="35.816">那麼懦</span><span begin="35.816" end="37.270">弱</span> <span begin="37.896" end="39.272">无可奈</span><span begin="39.272" end="41.126">何</span></p></div><div begin="42.602" end="1:09.707" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="42.602" end="44.438" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.602" end="44.438">那时候的梦想很小</span></p><p begin="44.488" end="47.135" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.488" end="45.538">小到能</span><span begin="45.538" end="46.587">够陪着你就</span><span begin="46.587" end="47.135">好</span></p><p begin="47.400" end="51.248" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.400" end="48.177">可是我</span><span begin="48.177" end="49.949">又没有能力</span><span begin="49.949" end="51.248">办不到</span></p><p begin="51.697" end="55.054" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.697" end="52.500">陪着我</span><span begin="52.500" end="53.844">就是煎</span><span begin="53.844" end="55.054">熬</span></p><p begin="56.420" end="1:00.370" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.420" end="57.723">说我们不要</span><span begin="57.723" end="1:00.370">那些远大目标</span></p><p begin="1:00.380" end="1:03.641" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.380" end="1:00.783">有你</span><span begin="1:00.783" end="1:03.641">在的地方就好</span></p><p begin="1:03.971" end="1:09.707" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.971" end="1:05.041">是我胆</span><span begin="1:05.041" end="1:05.733">小</span> <span begin="1:05.733" end="1:06.761">就连回</span><span begin="1:06.761" end="1:07.305">去</span><span begin="1:07.305" end="1:09.014">的车票也凑不</span><span begin="1:09.014" end="1:09.707">到</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.609" end="1:38.009" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:10.609" end="1:12.893" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.609" end="1:10.841">一</span><span begin="1:10.841" end="1:11.705">次次的</span><span begin="1:11.705" end="1:12.893">推开你</span></p><p begin="1:13.486" end="1:16.528" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.486" end="1:14.478">忙到忘记我</span><span begin="1:14.478" end="1:15.577">忙碌的</span><span begin="1:15.577" end="1:16.528">意义</span></p><p begin="1:17.124" end="1:19.976" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.124" end="1:17.929">只想</span><span begin="1:17.929" end="1:18.665">把最好</span><span begin="1:18.665" end="1:19.976">都给你</span></p><p begin="1:20.389" end="1:23.752" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.389" end="1:21.433">却忽略了你</span><span begin="1:21.433" end="1:22.813">无声的叹</span><span begin="1:22.813" end="1:23.752">息</span></p><p begin="1:24.422" end="1:30.774" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.422" end="1:24.924">是我</span><span begin="1:24.924" end="1:27.012">没出息</span> <span begin="1:27.757" end="1:29.934">所以只能靠努</span><span begin="1:29.934" end="1:30.774">力</span></p><p begin="1:31.409" end="1:38.009" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.409" end="1:31.876">是我</span><span begin="1:31.876" end="1:33.888">没勇气</span> <span begin="1:34.737" end="1:35.286">弄丢了</span><span begin="1:35.286" end="1:36.902">最好的</span><span begin="1:36.902" end="1:38.009">你</span></p></div><div begin="1:38.412" end="2:05.096" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:38.412" end="1:44.870" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.412" end="1:39.487">整个房间</span><span begin="1:39.487" end="1:40.982">空空荡</span><span begin="1:40.982" end="1:41.251">荡</span> <span begin="1:41.251" end="1:41.888">瘫</span><span begin="1:41.888" end="1:42.151">坐</span><span begin="1:42.151" end="1:43.120">在</span><span begin="1:43.505" end="1:44.870">沙发</span></p><p begin="1:45.319" end="1:51.749" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.319" end="1:46.405">眼泪落</span><span begin="1:46.405" end="1:47.120">在</span><span begin="1:47.120" end="1:48.604">了枕头上</span> <span begin="1:48.762" end="1:50.578">烫一个个</span><span begin="1:50.578" end="1:50.810">的</span><span begin="1:50.810" end="1:51.749">疤</span></p><p begin="1:52.270" end="1:58.974" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.270" end="1:52.744">时钟</span><span begin="1:52.744" end="1:54.456">滴滴答答</span> <span begin="1:54.456" end="1:55.175">安静</span><span begin="1:55.175" end="1:57.359">得很</span><span begin="1:57.417" end="1:57.752">可</span><span begin="1:57.752" end="1:58.974">怕</span></p><p begin="1:59.229" end="2:05.096" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.229" end="2:00.060">思念无</span><span begin="2:00.060" end="2:00.832">声</span> <span begin="2:00.903" end="2:01.391">是给</span><span begin="2:01.391" end="2:02.706">我的惩</span><span begin="2:02.706" end="2:05.096">罚</span></p></div><div begin="2:05.621" end="2:33.460" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:05.621" end="2:11.493" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.621" end="2:06.952">那道门好</span><span begin="2:06.952" end="2:07.976">像</span> <span begin="2:08.255" end="2:09.644">是道</span><span begin="2:09.644" end="2:09.929">枷</span><span begin="2:09.929" end="2:11.493">锁</span></p><p begin="2:11.829" end="2:19.208" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.829" end="2:13.214">困住了</span><span begin="2:13.214" end="2:15.062">我</span> <span begin="2:15.303" end="2:16.600">动弹不</span><span begin="2:16.600" end="2:19.208">得</span></p><p begin="2:19.509" end="2:25.632" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.509" end="2:20.972">发呆着难</span><span begin="2:20.972" end="2:22.046">过</span> <span begin="2:22.177" end="2:22.541">失</span><span begin="2:22.541" end="2:23.629">去</span><span begin="2:23.629" end="2:25.632">你的我</span></p><p begin="2:25.836" end="2:33.460" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.836" end="2:27.096">那麼懦</span><span begin="2:27.096" end="2:28.790">弱</span> <span begin="2:29.176" end="2:30.552">无可奈</span><span begin="2:30.552" end="2:33.460">何</span></p></div><div begin="2:34.508" end="2:48.339" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:34.508" end="2:38.432" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.508" end="2:38.432">逃到没你的地方去吧</span></p><p begin="2:38.883" end="2:41.981" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.883" end="2:41.981">搬到一个没你的家</span></p><p begin="2:42.172" end="2:44.616" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.172" end="2:42.955">把所有</span><span begin="2:42.955" end="2:44.616">的都留下</span></p><p begin="2:44.780" end="2:48.339" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.780" end="2:46.408">就算我给你</span><span begin="2:46.408" end="2:47.294">的亏欠</span><span begin="2:47.294" end="2:48.339">吧</span></p></div><div begin="2:47.382" end="3:15.109" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:47.382" end="2:53.254" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.382" end="2:48.713">那道门好</span><span begin="2:48.713" end="2:49.822">像</span> <span begin="2:49.979" end="2:51.381">是道</span><span begin="2:51.381" end="2:51.690">枷</span><span begin="2:51.690" end="2:53.254">锁</span></p><p begin="2:53.648" end="3:00.927" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.648" end="2:55.033">困住了</span><span begin="2:55.033" end="2:56.881">我</span> <span begin="2:57.122" end="2:58.419">动弹不</span><span begin="2:58.419" end="3:00.927">得</span></p><p begin="3:01.197" end="3:07.320" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.197" end="3:02.705">发呆着难</span><span begin="3:02.705" end="3:03.760">过</span> <span begin="3:03.891" end="3:04.260">失</span><span begin="3:04.260" end="3:05.298">去</span><span begin="3:05.298" end="3:06.150">你的</span><span begin="3:06.150" end="3:07.320">我</span></p><p begin="3:07.518" end="3:15.109" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.518" end="3:08.755">那麼懦</span><span begin="3:08.755" end="3:10.656">弱</span> <span begin="3:10.953" end="3:12.294">无可奈</span><span begin="3:12.294" end="3:15.109">何</span></p></div></body></tt>